id: CTB-SRC0014-5-1
source: SRC-0014
section: §5.1
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000109
text: The platform must support configurable payment integrations, with initial Indian-market requirements including Razorpay, PhonePe, UPI and platform wallets. The architecture must accommodate additional payment gateways, processors, banks, payment methods, currencies and future payment technologies.
